meeting a keep-warm lease runs unretained with the stated reason naming the holder; and when a holder's lease expires while it is still running, the next adjudication retires that session and mints rather than resuming it. Under store-lock contention, assert a bookkept active or draining call, an authentication-failure release, a keep-warm ping and a scope retirement publish durably and apply before expiry retirement on the next locked read; a pending release remains warm-eligible; a reader never deletes a marker it did not apply; with every marker deletion failing, a replayed bookkeep neither frees a newer holder's lease nor overwrites its observation, competing resumed calls receive the session once, and replayed release, call-retirement and scope-retirement markers are inert; a call that overran its lease and bookkeeps after its successor took the route leaves that record untouched; malformed markers are removed as absent, unreadable markers remain and hold back expiry retirement, and a failed publication reaches the caller. Assert blackout retirement overrides a pending chain after the window, permits an in-window wrap-up resume, and suppresses keep-warm inside the window.\""," tier = \"Smoke\"","-expected = \"Satisfies LLR-270 (parent SR-227) with the dial on: each runner's resume and occupancy are read from its own output under its dedicated home, every ruled reset rule holds, and the store is written whole by one holder at a time. The blackout exception retires stale or missing last use before a later keep-warm lease, without weakening ordinary chain continuity.\"","+expected = \"Satisfies LLR-270 (parent SR-227) with the dial on: each runner's resume and occupancy are read from its own output under its dedicated home, every ruled reset rule holds, and the store is written whole by one holder at a time. The blackout exception retires stale or missing last use before a later keep-warm lease, without weakening ordinary chain continuity. Under contention, a finished call's observation, reset decision and lease release, and a scope retirement, remain durable until the next locked read applies them before expiry retirement; no reader deletes an unapplied marker. A marker takes effect at most once and never changes a record another call holds.\""," automated = \"Yes\"","-evidence = \"tests/test_session_keep.py;tests/test_adjudicator_token.py::test_an_auth_failure_records_the_call_failed_and_keeps_the_session;tests/test_adjudicator_token.py::test_an_auth_failure_on_a_first_mint_leaves_no_record;tests/test_adjudicator_token.py::test_another_failure_still_retires_the_session;tests/test_blackout_window.py::test_the_first_keep_call_after_a_window_retires_by_the_predicate;tests/test_blackout_window.py::test_a_draining_sessions_chain_does_not_survive_the_window;tests/test_blackout_window.py::test_a_wrap_up_inside_the_window_resumes_the_retained_session;tests/test_blackout_window.py::test_no_keep_warm_ping_fires_inside_the_window;tests/test_blackout_window.py::test_a_keep_warm_tick_first_after_the_window_retires_and_never_refreshes\"","+evidence = \"tests/test_session_keep.py::test_a_bookkept_call_under_contention_keeps_its_observation_and_resumes;tests/test_session_keep.py::test_a_draining_call_under_contention_drains_and_is_not_retired;tests/test_session_keep.py::test_an_auth_failure_release_under_contention_never_retires_the_session;tests/test_session_keep.py::test_a_keep_warm_ping_under_contention_leaves_no_lease_and_stays_warm;tests/test_session_keep.py::test_a_release_marker_never_makes_keep_warm_skip_the_record;tests/test_session_keep.py::test_a_reader_that_saw_expiry_after_a_release_was_published_does_not_retire;tests/test_session_keep.py::test_a_reader_never_deletes_a_marker_it_did_not_apply;tests/test_session_keep.py::test_retire_scope_under_contention_retires_on_the_next_read;tests/test_session_keep.py::test_a_retire_marker_spares_a_newer_session_and_a_lease_it_does_not_hold;tests/test_session_keep.py::test_a_malformed_mar